<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.13 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.01 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.46 vs   1.38</p>
<p> Sales		   13.21 vs  10.14</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.62 vs   4.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.10 vs   6.33</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.75 vs   5.64</p>
<p> Sales		  109.36 vs  59.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer software firm is</p>
<p>ComputerLand SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
